    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fantastic 4 bedroom detached bungalow located in Julianstown, Co. Meath. Situated on a c. 1.3 acre private site, the property has bright and spacious living areas and boasts large surrounding gardens with ample parking to the front. The property which extends to c. 135 sq.m. (1,453 sq.ft.) offers huge appeal and a lot of potential. This property provides extensive accommodation throughout and although in need of some modernisation, there is immense scope and potential to create something special in this excellent location. This is a quality home in a prime family location within easy access of Bettystown village - 10 minute drive and Drogheda Town Centre - 10 minute drive. Gormanston and Laytown Train Stations are both within a 5 minute drive, with access to the M1 Motorway only 5 minutes away. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate this property.\r\n\r\nAMV - €625,000 – For Sale by Private Treaty"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nLiving Room\t\t(4.86m x 4.04m)\r\nKitchen\t\t        (3.90m x 2.86m)\r\nDining Room\t\t(4.25m x 3.91m)\r\nGuest Bathroom\t(0.90m x 1.96m)\r\n\r\nUtility Room\t\t(1.60m x 1.60m)\r\nGarage/Office\t(5.05m x 2.98m)\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t\t(2.92m x 3.90m)\r\nBedroom 2\t\t(2.72m x 3.84m)\r\nBedroom 3\t\t(2.80m x 2.76m)\r\nBedroom 4 \t\t(2.86m x 2.73m)\r\nMain Bathroom\t(2.88m x 1.48m)"
      },
